ENGLISH SUMMARY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This package contains NO game assets. You must own Plants vs. Zombies
(Steam app 3590, EA App, or original PopCap CD) to use it. The launcher only
copies files from your own storage into your own home directory and never
uploads anything. The bundled engine is PvZ-Portable, an independent open
source reimplementation (LGPL-3.0-or-later), not EA code.

Plants vs. Zombies is a trademark of Electronic Arts Inc. This is an
unofficial, non-commercial project, not affiliated with or endorsed by EA or
PopCap. Provided without warranty of any kind.
